&"1_1": {
"dialogue": "What do you want to know?",
"offset": Vector2(-240, -120),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_3",
"text": "How was your relationship with your Father?"
},
1: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_7",
"text": "Where were you before I came to the Manor?"
},
2: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_2",
"text": "We'll talk later..."
}
},
"size": Vector2(399.99927, 343.00024),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_10": {
"dialogue": "My my, you're onto me, well go ahead, what do you think I was doing?",
"offset": Vector2(1620, 540),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0006, 279.99976),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_11": {
"dialogue": "Assume what you must, I don't like how you're going about this.",
"offset": Vector2(1415.7825, 160.83109),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"3_1",
"text": "Ok..."
}
},
"size": Vector2(320, 280),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_12": {
"dialogue": "Huh? Well, you got me there, yes I did enter his room, but that still doesn't explain how he died. ",
"offset": Vector2(-1240, 220),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_14",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(339.9995, 280.00024),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_13": {
"dialogue": "Ha! Nice try, but it ain't easy to accuse somebody like me! ",
"offset": Vector2(-1040, 540),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_1",
"text": "Uh oh..."
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 273),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_14": {
"dialogue": "I was there to help him, I wouldn't even think to do any harm!",
"offset": Vector2(-820, 240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"3_5",
"text": "Interesting..."
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 279.9995),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_15": {
"dialogue": "Oh, what is this? Why are you holding these dirty gloves? ",
"offset": Vector2(-1160, 860),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_23",
"text": "I found them under the table"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 279.99976),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_16": {
"dialogue": "I got rid of him... and that was the only way I could have secured the company!",
"offset": Vector2(-200, 1400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_18",
"text": "How did you kill him?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 319.99976),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_17": {
"dialogue": "OK FINE! I admit it! I can't run away from this, can't I? ",
"offset": Vector2(-560, 1320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_16",
"text": "What did you do?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(319.99915, 319.99902),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_18": {
"dialogue": "[wait speed=5] Its... poison. (regret) [/wait]",
"offset": Vector2(140, 1300),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_19",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00122, 240.00043),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_19": {
"dialogue": "A slow poison extracted from the plants in the garden...",
"offset": Vector2(500, 1240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_24",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 240.00043),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_2": {
"dialogue": "Let me know if you want to know anything else, I got all day.",
"offset": Vector2(300, 480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00085, 260.0005),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_20": {
"dialogue": "I was treated a a child, even when I clearly knew what I as doing. [wait time=1] I guess my dad was right. I shouldn't have done it...",
"offset": Vector2(1240, 1100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_21",
"text": "I am sorry, but I have to arrest you right now, this is a serious crime..."
},
1: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_22",
"text": "Why did you do this?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(419.9995, 339.9994),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_21": {
"dialogue": "I know, I am really sorry, I don't know how am I possibly going to recover from this... (sobs)",
"offset": Vector2(1720, 1040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"3_8",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00073, 279.99976),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_22": {
"dialogue": "I wanted to run the company by my rules, and dad wasn't really ready to give it to me, [wait time=1] instead he decided to give it to Lillian, so I had to do something... (sobs)",
"offset": Vector2(1700, 1400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"3_8",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(319.99902, 320),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_23": {
"dialogue": "Hey, where did you find that?? That's not something you should touch! [shake]It's dangerous! [/shake]",
"offset": Vector2(-740, 820),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"3_6",
"text": "Oh? You know this?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 320.00055),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_24": {
"dialogue": "I put it on the puzzle box when I went there before, when my Father wasn't looking and distracted by the smoke I caused.",
"offset": Vector2(840, 1120),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_20",
"text": "Why?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 299.99945),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_3": {
"dialogue": "My father and I were close, we understood each other very well. [wait time=1] I am heartbroken to see him go like this...",
"offset": Vector2(280, -440),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_5",
"text": "Did you enter Alistair's room before the dinner?"
},
1: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_4",
"text": "No you're not! I think you did it."
}
},
"size": Vector2(399.99963, 320),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_4": {
"dialogue": "Hey, don't go falsely accusing like that! Doesn't suit well for a reputed detective like you! Ha! ",
"offset": Vector2(960, -200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"3_1",
"text": "Hmm... My bad."
}
},
"size": Vector2(319.99915, 320),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_5": {
"dialogue": "No I did not, I was in the dinner hall reading a book. I had no reason to go meet him.",
"offset": Vector2(960, -560),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"3_2",
"text": "I have evidence to prove you went in there!"
},
1: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_1",
"text": "Ok... I can believe that."
}
},
"size": Vector2(379.99976, 320),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_6": {
"dialogue": "Oh, now we're talking, what exactly proves that I went there?",
"offset": Vector2(1840, -540),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 260),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_7": {
"dialogue": "Let's see... I was first in the garden roaming about with my book and studying the plants, then I went inside beacause of the storm.",
"offset": Vector2(300, 20),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_8",
"text": "Ok... then?"
},
1: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_9",
"text": "What were you doing in the Garden exactly?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(379.9989, 308.00024),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_8": {
"dialogue": "Then I was in the hall sitting with my book and helping out Lillian in making dinner.",
"offset": Vector2(880, 140),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_1",
"text": "Ok..."
},
1: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_11",
"text": "Nope I won't fall for this! Are you trying to trick me?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(420.00098, 308),
"speaker": 2
},
&"1_9": {
"dialogue": "Oh, I was studying the plants for my research on plant substances, how they react with human skin, all that, you won't understand.",
"offset": Vector2(800, 440),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_1",
"text": "Interesting..."
},
1: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"3_3",
"text": "I have evidence you were doing something else as well"
}
},
"size": Vector2(459.99927, 308),
"speaker": 2
},
